# Secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Generated
# The Meridian dataset is regenerable in seconds from a fixed seed (make data), so it
# does not belong in version control. Nor do trained models: they are rebuilt from the
# same seeds, and a binary in git is a binary nobody can review.
/data/
/artifacts/
# MLflow's local tracking store and artifacts, from Chapter 15.
mlruns/
mlartifacts/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# The runner's per-call usage log: append-only output, a megabyte a run, and rewritten
# every time. `_report.json` next to it IS committed — it is the staleness cache, and a
# fresh clone needs it to know the captured output is current without re-running.
code/_usage.jsonl
